5. `shadowbonk.html:134` — `spawnBoss` now `ENS.push(...)` (live array) instead of `EN.push(...)` (content catalog), so the boss actually spawns and `bossAlive` can clear via the `e.boss` kill path at line 180.
6. `shadowbonk.html:92-94` — `pick()` maps `damage→dmg` and `projectiles→proj` before `P[s]+=u.delta`, because `sb_upgrades_a.json:61,69,77` and `sb_upgrades_b.json:37,45,53` ship those stat names while `P` (line 81) has `dmg`/`proj`; previously `undefined + delta = NaN`.

